&lt;p&gt;Join us to do the best work of your career, solving meaningful problems with remarkable teams.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Greenhouse is looking for an &lt;strong&gt;Enterprise Account Manager &lt;/strong&gt;to join our team!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our Account Management team drives customer retention, growth and expansion opportunities, as well as continued product optimization and adoption. As an Enterprise Account Manager, you will own the renewals and upselling of new products into our rapidly growing ecosystem of customers. You will ensure a premium experience for our customers by understanding their core business objectives and motivating change in their organization. In addition, you’ll partner with our Customer Success, Marketing, Product and Finance teams to streamline workflows and communication processes within Greenhouse.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
