&lt;li&gt;Develop strategic account plans that map out expansion and other upsell opportunities&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain an active pipeline of forecasted renewals and expansions to meet quota objectives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Customer Success Managers and leverage product expertise to solution for customer pain points&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Position yourself as a strategic partner to key stakeholders and champions within named accounts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Diagnose and clearly mitigate churn risks, owning resolution strategies and advising sales leadership on ideal resolutions wherever appropriate&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be an active participant in building and improving internal operational processes&lt;/li&gt;
