&lt;li&gt;Excellent project management skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The ability to construct, present, and defend complex pricing structures directly with procurement and finance, not just manage the relationships around them&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to solve complex problems through a consultative approach, effectively managing customer expectations while navigating challenges often outside of your direct control&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mastery in lifecycle revenue management, delivering high-accuracy forecasting for both renewals and expansion within a complex enterprise portfolio&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience acting as a strategic advisor to senior leadership by synthesizing portfolio data into actionable insights regarding market themes, risk mitigation strategies, and growth opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with HR industry and SaaS, a plus&lt;/li&gt;
