&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Working model:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Collaboration with a distributed, US &amp;amp; Canada-based team, with reasonable availability for coordination during core Greenhouse working hours&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who will love this job&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A Product-Minded Engineer&lt;/strong&gt; – You don&#39;t just write code; you understand the end-user experience and can make thoughtful, directionally correct technical decisions aligned with product vision.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A Data-Experience Builder&lt;/strong&gt; – You are energized by crafting crisp, responsive, data-rich applications and internal tools using modern TypeScript and frontend/backend patterns.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A Pragmatic Innovator&lt;/strong&gt; – You actively leverage AI-assisted development (such as agentic coding workflows) to streamline your day-to-day work, increase throughput, and spend more time solving high-leverage problems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A Quality Champion&lt;/strong&gt; – You care deeply about engineering standards, strong automated test coverage, and building durable software that stands the test of time.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Implement net-new functionality into the core Analytics platform to drive strategic company priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain and optimize existing Analytics products, ensuring high availability, performance, and UI responsiveness.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner daily with Data Experience engineers, Product Managers, Product Designers, and members of the Data Platform team to take features from ideation to production.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Write robust automated tests, contribute to code reviews, and help raise the technical baseline across the codebase.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work fluently with agentic coding assistants and modern AI developer tools to ship features faster and improve developer ergonomics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You should have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of experience shipping production-grade TypeScript and React applications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;1+ years of hands-on experience building data-rich applications or dashboards where performance, UI responsiveness, and state management matter.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Duckdb, a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record of delivering clean, maintainable code backed by high levels of automated test coverage.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort and proficiency using AI-assisted/agentic coding tools in your daily development workflow.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication and cross-functional collaboration skills in a remote, distributed environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who we are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Greenhouse, we live by our mission through &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.greenhouse.com/interviewing-at-greenhouse&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;using our own product&lt;/a&gt; to help us hire the right person for the job, every time. We’re committed to designing and responsibly using AI tools to transform how we work while keeping people at the center. We are a remote-first company and have shared office spaces in New York City and Ireland, and optional co-working spaces that give us flexibility to do our best work anywhere. We take an active role in our growth through a performance review program that’s committed to providing actionable feedback, and a bonus structure that rewards great performance. We believe that bringing together a variety of perspectives makes us a stronger company – and we nurture leaders who create an inclusive culture and invest into employee resource groups that celebrate our differences and life experiences. We’re proud to have built an&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.greenhouse.com/awards&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;award-winning culture&lt;/a&gt; that’s been recognized as Fortune’s Best Places to Work and Inc.’s Best Workplaces multiple years in a row.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
